{"format":"tvf-scene","v":1,"name":"example · Solving 3x + 5 = 20","loop":12,"ease":"inout","hold":0,"gravity":1,"wind":0,"trail":null,"camera":[],"stops":[0.175,0.3917,0.6,0.8583],"beats":[{"title":"An equation","text":"Three of something and [five more](#lit:2,3) make [twenty](#lit:5). What is the [something](#lit:1)?"},{"title":"The five crosses","text":"Take five from both sides. On the left it is gone; on the right it stands [taken away](#lit:6,3)."},{"title":"Twenty less five","text":"Twenty less five is [fifteen](#lit:7): three of the something make fifteen."},{"title":"The three goes under","text":"Divide both sides by [three](#lit:0). It leaves the x and stands [under the fifteen](#lit:8,0)."},{"title":"Five","text":"Fifteen in threes is [five](#lit:9). The [something](#lit:1) is five."}],"path":null,"items":[{"fill":{"color":"#f4f1ea","opacity":1},"stroke":null,"width":0,"open":false,"exact":{"x":[-0.9,0.9,0.9,-0.9],"y":[0.3825,0.3825,-0.3825,-0.3825],"r":null,"smooth":null,"ctrl":null,"holes":[]}},{"morph":0},{"morph":1},{"morph":2},{"morph":3},{"morph":4},{"morph":10},{"morph":5},{"morph":11},{"morph":6},{"morph":7},{"morph":12},{"morph":8},{"morph":9}],"morphs":[{"exact":true,"open":false,"holes":null,"keys":[{"x":[-0.4383225,-0.4291875,-0.423945,-0.417645,-0.4124475,-0.407115,-0.40491,-0.40239,-0.401355,-0.400725,-0.400365,-0.400365,-0.400725,-0.40248,-0.40464,-0.4068225,-0.4106925,-0.4160475,-0.4207275,-0.4211775,-0.41499,-0.409365,-0.405135,-0.40275,-0.401535,-0.40014,-0.399015,-0.39789,-0.397845,-0.3990375,-0.40041,-0.40221,-0.4041675,-0.4068225,-0.40995,-0.41247,-0.4160475,-0.420885,-0.4275,-0.4328325,-0.438165,-0.44676,-0.4513275,-0.4541625,-0.4563,-0.46026,-0.46404,-0.4658175,-0.467235,-0.4689,-0.469215,-0.468765,-0.449775,-0.44919,-0.4485825,-0.447525,-0.44631,-0.44451,-0.4420575,-0.4397175,-0.437265,-0.43425,-0.43146,-0.428985,-0.4260825,-0.42417,-0.42246,-0.42075,-0.418995,-0.418095,-0.41814,-0.4192425,-0.4214475,-0.42426,-0.42786,-0.4322925,-